  {
   "id": "hexologic-86323@major-2022-03-29",
   "gameId": "hexologic-86323",
   "displayName": "Hexologic Linux Update - Infinite Mode Added!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-03-29T12:02:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Here we are with a long awaited update for many of our fans here - Hexologic on Linux receives the most recent content update, the great Infinite Mode!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We updated the code, added a bunch of improvements and build updates to make it a smooth experience, whether you're on x64 or x86. We noticed that some of you experienced progress loss and registering issues and they should be history with today's update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, we are looking forward to your feedback on both our Steam Discussions or Discord, so feel free to join and take part in improving our current and upcoming games. ːsteamhappyː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👉 https://discord.gg/e69WDgdbKW 👈",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "What can you expect joining our community?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎁 Giveaways (including our award-winning puzzler Hexologic!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "😃 Most awesome puzzle recommendations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "💎 Exclusive content from Harmony's Odyssey - not available anywhere else",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🛠️ Work-in-progress content (including some of our most crazy ideas!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎨 The most awesome concept art and drawings from our talented team - added one today! ;)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "📅 First hand info about events, expo's and fairs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🤣 Fun!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
